=== Setup complete for /opt/appdata/fdroid ===

Next steps:
  1. Edit /opt/appdata/fdroid/config.yml — set actual keystorepass and keypass
  2. Copy APKs to /opt/appdata/fdroid/repo/
  3. Copy metadata .yml files to /opt/appdata/fdroid/metadata/
  4. Run:  cd /opt/appdata/fdroid && fdroid update --pretty --delete-unknown
  5. Ensure Nginx/Caddy serves /opt/appdata/fdroid/repo at https://fdroid.northstarlabs.net/repo
sidscri@sidscri-services:/opt/appdata/fdroid$
